;;; restriction.mtf -- restriction endonuclease recognition sites.
;;;
;;; Sites are written the way REBASE writes them:
;;;   "G^AATTC"      cut after G on the top strand; the bottom cut mirrors it
;;;   "G^AATT_C"     explicit top (^) and bottom (_) cuts
;;;   "GGTCTC(1/5)"  Type IIS: cuts 1 and 5 bases past the site
;;; Sequences may use IUPAC ambiguity codes (N R Y W S K M B D H V).
;;;
;;; Reference: Roberts et al., REBASE, Nucleic Acids Research (rebase.neb.com).

